c3-guide-mcp contains material from other projects:

- data/corpus.rs is a snapshot generated from the C3 project (https://github.com/c3lang/c3c and
  https://c3-lang.org): the language manual, the release notes, and the documentation and signatures
  of the standard library. The C3 project licenses everything outside the compiler source (src/) under
  the MIT license; this includes the standard library and its documentation. The snapshot is
  Copyright (c) the C3 contributors.
- deps/mcp.c3l (not part of this repository, fetched at build time) is the MCP SDK by Koni Marti, MIT.

The compiler c3c itself (LGPL 3.0) is not included or linked: c3_check starts it as a separate process
from the user's installation.
